Package: MSdemo
Title: Demo LC-MS data for the MSdev package
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Rui", "Li", , "rli@sinh.ac.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3199-287X"))
Description: Experiment data package for MSdev. Points at an anonymized
    dual-polarity LC-MS demo on Zenodo (QC, blank, and three sample
    groups; 3 replicates each). Use MSdemo_download_dataset() after install
    to fetch the raw files, then locate them and rebuild processed MSdev objects.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports:
    curl,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    MSdev,
    MSconvertR
biocViews: ExperimentData, MassSpectrometryData
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/DrRuiLi/MSdemo
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
